  title: Finish the labels
  story: Some labels still need to be written or repaired. Help spell the words in
    Lemko.
  instructions: '1. Look at the picture and its meaning. Right-click either for the
    Lemko spelling.

    2. Click or drag letters into the slots. Tap a filled slot to
    return its letter.

    3. Finish or repair the word, then choose Check answer.'
